1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,886
That lightning rod was Franklin's idea.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,760
Lightning takes the easiest path to the ground.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,680
A wooden roof is a terrible path, so it bursts

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,440
into flame.

5
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,180
A metal rod is an easy one.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,740
The lightning runs down the rod, round the building,

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:16,920
and into the earth.

8
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,780
Some towers are struck over 20 times a year.
